  "question": {
    "text": "In the diagram shown below, both the strings $A B$ and $C D$ are made of same material and have same cross-section. The pulleys are light and fictionless. If the speed of wave in string $A B$ is $v_1$ and in $C D$ is $v_2$, then $\\frac{v_1}{v_2}$ is\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/KcmsJruf_zJD-FmbOZ5Tbb2sh-_WbMzr1hs2wiLMZpU.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
