    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/WLHC607-XBSHYYUfIPQtPzzvqoOMBp9UjPn556gClac.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\nLet the speed of wave in string be $v$ and tension in string be $T$.\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{gathered}\r\nv \\propto \\sqrt{T} \\\\\r\n\\frac{v_{A B}}{v_{C D}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{T}{2 T}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\r\n\\end{gathered}\r\n$$",
